{
  "_comment": [
    "Strata run config for Qwen3.8-Flash-Next UD-IQ4_XS on gfx1151 (Strix Halo,",
    "128 GB unified). This is the configuration the numbers in docs/strata.md",
    "were measured with. Three entries are not tuning and must not be dropped:",
    "",
    "  --mmap-experts        without it the engine keeps a pinned host arena AND",
    "                        a GPU-resident cache, 55.43 GiB EACH. On an APU both",
    "                        come out of the same RAM, so that is 110.9 of 121.6",
    "                        GiB and the kernel kills it. Replaces the upstream",
    "                        benchmark's --resident-budget-gib, gone since v0.1.41.",
    "  --ple-io direct       keeps the 26.8 GiB n-gram table on SSD. The engine's",
    "                        residency policy promotes it when RAM looks free, so",
    "                        freeing memory makes it greedier.",
    "  reasoning_effort      the server-side fuse. Flash-Next thinks by default;",
    "                        a client that sends no reasoning_effort spends its",
    "                        whole budget on reasoning_content and returns",
    "                        content: null with finish_reason: length -- an empty",
    "                        answer, not an error.",
    "",
    "And never reserve hugepages for this: the arena is cudaHostRegister-ed and",
    "cannot draw from hugetlbfs, so a reservation is memory it can never use."
  ],
  "model": "qwen3.8-flash-next",
  "parallel": 2,
  "reasoning_effort": "none",
  "exe": "@STRATA_HOME@/engine/strata",
  "lib_dirs": [
    "@STRATA_HOME@/engine"
  ],
  "tokenizer": "@STRATA_HOME@/pack/tokenizer",
  "args": [
    "--pack",
    "@STRATA_HOME@/pack",
    "--native",
    "@STRATA_NATIVE_GGUF@",
    "--ple-gguf",
    "@STRATA_PLE_GGUF@",
    "--ple-io",
    "direct",
    "--mmap-experts",
    "--mtp",
    "@STRATA_HOME@/mtp-rt",
    "--expert-profile",
    "@STRATA_HOME@/control/data/expert-profile.bin",
    "--expert-cache",
    "24576",
    "--prefill",
    "auto:16384",
    "--spec",
    "5",
    "--spec-min-p",
    "0.5",
    "--mtp-window",
    "8192",
    "--kv",
    "int8",
    "--max-context",
    "131072"
  ]
}
